WEBVTT

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:04.230
Recommend a workable option without promising it There may be

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:09.935
more than one defensible recommendation Operations might handle the delivery-sequence

00:00:09.935 --> 00:00:14.670
discussion if the required delegation and acceptance are obtained A

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:17.620
later executive slot may work if it meets the useful

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:22.280
decision time Changing the morning needs an explicit decision about

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:27.335
its consequences Lunch at another venue is a separate business

00:00:27.335 --> 00:00:32.555
protective and service-scope question Explore the conditions without inventing a

00:00:32.555 --> 00:00:37.565
reply Choose an option state its conditions and distinguish the

00:00:37.565 --> 00:00:43.045
executive’s business choice from EPO input and room acceptance Explore

00:00:43.045 --> 00:00:45.540
a different route after feedback
